      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是呀。父亲和母亲\n从来都没有要求我“要赢”。\n就只是以父母的身份很温柔地对待我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cee34daf2d9a158c1d0b403950ffcc183e1619b28cdf073932d4ae0d34c13790",
