    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c87da799338e27d16668de5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身为他们女儿的我成为“知名赛马娘”，\n把里见家一直梦寐以求的第一个荣耀献给他们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "221d75fef5128a2bf55359712d8f67efcc61a3a03b7220bb79ecc393f6363b44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
