    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6024712acd15bd161271232",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然也已经钉好了。\n……训练员，\n你不要那么紧张嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62f0ab49abb7387ae213e78e48cd91f4df3aca1aaae7218794bc02bae02817a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e955afd2c08148ef5d35af4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻给了我相当可靠的回答。\n保险起见，\n我决定明天要提早从特雷森学园出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5327084a0986cae71112f10d9ab3b65bfec2cb2f9a87f1ff449690d5eeb2ee38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab2a50e875d0e80d3271c41c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔天早上──雨并没有预期中的大，\n但确实吹着不间断的强风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b95f2d3122b2c9b5a009f81e9c5e391dcd2782bd2ebf18154688c715b35fd52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81935ec5b13eda2cf8dde205",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感觉电车很有可能因为强风而停驶。\n于是，我决定搭乘\n出租车前往中山赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e6f8f2fcfedbd26f005327db9b25dd37d669c4e7f49d0e26a11433d233e876",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067202.json",
